// Vector drawings dropped on the window (issue #9; `crate::drop_import`).
// 01 fixtures/vector/bracket.svg dropped on the Part Studio seen from the top: "Sketch 1" on Top
//    holds it, centred where it was dropped: a 60 × 30 plate with rounded corners (arcs), two
//    holes (circles) and a free-form slot (Béziers), its regions shaded.
// 02 Extruded 5 mm by the plate's region: the holes and the slot go through.
// 03 A new sketch on Top, fixtures/vector/bracket.eps (through Ghostscript and pdftocairo)
//    dropped into it to the plate's right: its curves added to the sketch, a 40 × 20 plate with
//    a rounded corner and a hole.
// 04 fixtures/logo.png dropped while sketching: not added, a note says to close the sketch.
// 05 Sketch accepted, fixtures/import_bracket.stl dropped on the Part Studio: "Import 1" with
//    the Import dialog open, as the toolbar's Import does once a file is picked.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("view 0 90"),
        Wait(10),
        Custom("drop-file fixtures/vector/bracket.svg"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("01-svg-dropped-as-sketch"),
        Click(ui("extrude")),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog"),
        ClickWorld(-15, 10),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(10),
        Custom("view -30 30"),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("02-extruded"),
        Custom("view 0 90"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("sketch")),
        WaitFor("sketch-dialog"),
        ClickAt(560, 575),
        Wait(5),
        MoveWorld(70, 0),
        Custom("drop-file fixtures/vector/bracket.eps"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("03-eps-dropped-into-sketch"),
        Custom("drop-file fixtures/logo.png"),
        WaitFor("drop-toast"),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("04-picture-refused-while-sketching"),
        Click(ui("sketch-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(5),
        Custom("drop-file fixtures/import_bracket.stl"),
        WaitFor("import-dialog"),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("05-stl-dropped-as-import"),
    ],
)
